Bootstrap: docker
From: nginx:1.27

%labels
    Component  koorm-nginx
    Wraps      nginx:1.27

%files
    # Bake the proxy config into the image. Certs are bind-mounted at runtime
    # to /etc/nginx/certs/ (see infra/scripts/gen-certs.sh).
    ../nginx/nginx.conf /etc/nginx/nginx.conf

%startscript
    # Writable scratch dir for pid + temp paths (image rootfs is read-only).
    mkdir -p /tmp/nginx
    # daemon off so apptainer keeps the instance alive in the foreground.
    exec nginx -g 'daemon off;'

%help
    KooRemapper Platform reverse proxy (TLS terminator).
    Listens 8443 (https) + 8080 (http→https). Proxies / and /api/ to the API
    (127.0.0.1:8700) and /mcp to the MCP server (127.0.0.1:8701, streaming).
    Bind-mount self-signed certs to /etc/nginx/certs/ at instance start.
    Build: apptainer build platform/infra/apptainer/nginx.sif platform/infra/apptainer/nginx.def
